ts, pigments, polymers and additives, press room chemicals, sugar chemicals, textile chemicals, water treatment chemicals, rust preventives, metalworking fluids, PU additives, and other specialty chemicals. Further, the company provides antibiotics, antifungal, anthelmintic medications, antihypertensive, analgesics, anti-diabetic drugs, neurotonics, antihistamines, painkillers, and cough syrups, as well as manufactures and supplies chemicals and solvents. Additionally, it engages in the contract manufacturing and outsourcing and supply of generic pharma formulation and medicines to healthcare institution, government, NGO, and hospitals. The company also exports its products to the United Kingdom, Australia, Uzbekistan, Syria, Oman, Taiwan, the Middle East, and North Africa regions. Sudarshan Pharma Industries Limited was incorporated in 2008 and is headquartered in Mumbai, India.","employees":64,"earnDates":[],"exDiv":null,"asOf":1795440946},"analyst":null,"cap":"Penny","caFix":null,"fetched":1795440946,"source":"Yahoo Finance (public chart, fundamentals-timeseries & quoteSummary endpoints)","news":{"q":"\"Sudarshan Pharma Industries\" when:90d","items":[{"t":"Sudarshan Pharma Industries Limited (SUDARSHAN.BO) Seasonal returns chart","s":"Yahoo Finance Australia","d":1795087504,"u":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMibEFVX3lxTE5SN01EY0ZQRG1iTGZ5RmhuWVNpYV9rTmdVaW1meWtkampERGlLSjhBSnFxMTZUVWlGNnFXRU0tRkVEblBWWkxlOU0yaDRMTGJJdXlJSm9IN2w1Nm9pQkk3bEREYkFFUWF3bDM0Tg?oc=5","g":[]},{"t":"Sudarshan Pharma Industries Ltd is Rated Hold","s":"MarketsMojo","d":1795029099,"u":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqwFBVV95cUxON2Rydko3ZjlvSWQ3ZjhRb0lZdUtZb0ZTSWhTTFRxWllMSzEzaHNxVlVBa0hRajJYRWt4UjA3YzRYUzdJUDhSaldfU1ljNGRfcnpJejVSRjdRbHhVVjlLQ084dnNiczQ2RGNWRExZTTNLYkd0ZHBIVlV6TVN6enE1bnFDLVhEYXhNUkRyM3l6dmV4NEItZVFDSzBicTRLR19EMUdDRWp5dzRQd0U?oc=5","g":[]},{"t":"Sudarshan Pharma FY26 revenue up 39% to ₹703 crore; PAT doubles","s":"scanx.trade","d":1794038400,"u":"https:/